00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.740
Himitsu no kobeya de

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.740
Shall I tell you about days long past

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:43.580
Inishie no hibi katarou ka?

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:43.580
In our secret little room?

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:46.790
Kioku ni dakarete

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:46.790
Embraced in memories

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:50.080
Kudakareta mysteria

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:50.080
The mysteria crumbles

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.840
Higeki wo koete

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.840
Once you overcome this tragedy

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.050
Odayaka na inori

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.050
Offer a gentle prayer

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:59.070
Owari ga hajimari

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:59.070
Endings are just beginnings

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:02.260
Shinsekai de hito wa mirai wo

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:02.260
People toss aside all they have

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.850
Bishu no you ni

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.850
Without ever knowing

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:08.320
Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:08.320
If they could drink up the new world

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.480
Subete houri nageta

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.480
Like a savory wine

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:14.640
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:14.640
The new world resides

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.360
Kiseki no hazama

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.360
Between boring logic and miracles

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:26.370
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:26.370
I wonder why this is where I first met you

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:35.590
Muneshige Tachibana, the Far East will lose

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:38.410
