00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:39.340
Tes.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:42.480
Such are the wishes of our lord,

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.970
and it is a samurai's job to see it happens.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.920
Then my father, Tadakatsu, clearly defeated you.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:52.000
"Opposition Against
Crossing Over the Parallel Lines"

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.970
My father's lord wished for Mikawa's obliteration,

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.690
and my father saw that it happened.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
And he gave Slicing Dragonfly to me.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.490
The sovereign I am meant to serve is being

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.700
wrongfully forced to commit suicide.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.660
What will you do about it?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.340
Since you are pushing her down that path,

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:11.170
as a Far East samurai, I shall defeat you.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.580
<i>It's me, the other Honda!</i>

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.520
<i>I'll have the paperwork done if you need</i>

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.760
<i>to tap that idiot's ether supply...</i>

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.840
Just hearing your voices is enough!

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.660
Asama Shrine
White Sand Plinth

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:21.970
<i>I see. In that case...</i>

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.680
<i>Go, temporary Vice Chancellor!</i>

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.850
My speed is superior to yours!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:32.810
<i>Don't debate over what to do!</i>

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:38.190
<i>Now I should...</i>

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.320
<i>Increase accuracy!</i>

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.110
<i>Lose unnecessary movement!</i>

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.420
<i>Shed all hesitation!</i>

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:50.580
<i>She isn't looking at me,
but where her speed's taking her.</i>

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:54.540
You're on!

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:55.920
Futayo, win!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.270
You spared my life when you defeated me.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.970
Now we're even.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:40.390
Most impressive. You have won.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.720
You are mistaken.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:47.780
I believe that my father severed your García name,

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:50.270
which was tied to your speed.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.180
If it looks like I won this fight, it is only because

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:56.650
my father already ascertained the outcome.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.950
You're offering my defeat to your predecessor?

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:05.930
You are not the type to lose
to one who lacks experience.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:07.650
My thanks...

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:13.290
The enemy leader, Muneshige Tachibana,

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.290
is down!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.690
The 1st Special Agent lost!

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.180
Send in a rescue team!

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:20.500
Have the student assistants take shelter!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.500
Master Muneshige...

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.870
<i>Since Muneshige Tachibana has fallen,</i>

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.040
<i>Tres España's aerial warships and troops</i>

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.250
<i>are starting to pull back.</i>

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:33.420
<i>But the inquisition warship hasn't cancelled</i>

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:35.330
<i>extracting the Armor of Deadly Sins.</i>

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.980
I pacified 'em back there.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.440
How's it looking here?

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.280
The Pope President has returned to the battlefront

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.050
and they're pushing us back.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:50.450
But Aoi's made it to the inquisition warship.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.860
Protect the Chancellor!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.450
Don't break formation!

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:52.600
Asama Shrine

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.130
<i>Don't you dare let the enemy through!</i>

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.950
I shall head on over.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:56.720
Same here.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:57.520
Wait.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:01.770
I have a job for you and Jizuri Suzaku.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:05.510
<i>We've got five minutes.</i>

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.210
<i>I'm counting on you!</i>

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.980
Hey, Horizon! You around?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.560
Do you need me for something?

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.140
I'm here to save you!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.900
I think it best to put bluntly:

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:23.900
Who are you?

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.650
You're bugging me, so please leave.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.550
enirhS ugnamneT onatiK

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.500
Suzu, enjoy the erotic cushion.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.610
It's me, me!

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:44.600
I'm a customer from Blue Thunder.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.090
Don't ya remember me?

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:47.780
Now I remember.

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:50.330
You often came for breakfast, correct?

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.720
Y-yeah, that's me!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:55.930
You'd always grab my hands
whenever I offered you change.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.940
Master nicknamed you Wet Man.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:03.880
<i>Sorry, but I'm seriously having to fight
using my Schwarze techno.</i>

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:07.110
<i>Same here, Margot. I'm doing likewise
with my Weisse techno.</i>

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.430
<i>You're horrible!</i>

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:10.050
Shut up!

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.730
What's wrong with
wanting to touch the woman you love?

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:13.760
I wanna touch her like this!

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.780
I forgot to mention,

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.580
but you'll die immediately upon touching this wall.

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:19.910
Whoa! That was close!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.250
What's with the exciting trap?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.390
Damn, why are you dressed?!

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:28.350
Normally you're naked in chains
if you're being held for heresy!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.880
I'm sorry! Please don't go.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:35.590
We used to see exchanges like this way back when.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:36.910
Right.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:40.300
She was explicitly strict with my foolish brother...

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.140
<i>She sure was...</i>

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:47.440
But we all knew just how much she cared for him.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:51.170
We may think that automated doll resembles her

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:57.090
