just like an automated doll.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:59.430
htnilP dnaS etihW
enirhS amasA

00:07:57.090 --> 00:07:58.220
<i>In that case...</i>

00:07:58.630 --> 00:07:59.450
Right.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:05.290
That automated doll might be
a naturally good fit for Horizon.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.780
I wish to make the best choice and avoid

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.880
