00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:14.080
To hell with the world!

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.720
It would "inconvenience" me if you died!

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:21.140
I ask, "Which is more important, you or the world?"

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:22.810
Which do you think?

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:25.350
Bluntly put, the world.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:26.810
There you have it!

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:30.710
I'll just have to become king of the world.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.890
As long as we've got your Armor,

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.380
