00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:45.120
So next on my agenda,

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.440
Horizon, is conquering the world together with you.

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:52.710
So while we're preventing
the apocalypse and making out,

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:55.880
I'll get back everything that was
stolen from you because of me.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.600
So I'm begging you, world!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.290
Could ya fork over the Armors?

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.100
If not, let's go to war!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.810
We'll fight, butt heads, face off, negotiate or whatever.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:10.350
I'll use whatever excuse it takes
to get Horizon's emotions back.

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:12.520
Shinto, Buddhism, Catholic, Protestant, Mlasi,

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:15.220
Anglican Church, Russian Orthodox Church, Dunhi, Oat,

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:17.540
