00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.870
mechanical beasts, phoenixes and
dragons, aerial warships,

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.110
humans, different beings,

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:24.770
civilians, knights, musketeers, samurai, ninja, warriors,

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:27.800
kings, nobles, sovereigns, dynasts, emperors, popes,

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:31.410
