Divine Weapons, Armors of Deadly Sins,
Testament Armament,

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.530
Five Great Peaks, Eight Great Dragon Kings,
Supreme Federation, Student Council,

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:46.450
men, women, and those who are neither,

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:48.940
the young and old, the dead and the living,

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.870
and the emotions, logic,
resolution and everything experienced

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:56.380
