00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.460
<i>He's insane!</i>

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:07.960
Huh?

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:12.200
<i>How did my confession turn into
a declaration of world domination?</i>

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.710
Think before you speak!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:16.220
Huh? Hmn?

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.120
I see.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:21.740
I conclude that your theory
was clear and easy to understand.

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:23.180
For real?!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:27.520
But that is your theory, not mine.

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:32.030
We are inversely parallel and ultimately,
you are bugging me.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.620
Please leave.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.400
I do not want the Far East to be put

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.110
at a disadvantage because of me.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.950
Even if I say that I don't want to lose you?

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:44.830
And why is that?

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:45.590
Eh?

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.590
Well, I'm too embarrassed
to say in front of everyone...

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:52.540
