00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.510
Huh? Sir Tori, aren't you done yet?

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:56.630
Reel her in!

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:59.520
My, my. You come to push me along?

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:01.140
Listen well!

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:05.100
